SUMMARY:Haunted House Trip - Wharton
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nHere we go!
  We're trying this again. Last chance!!!\n\nThis event is not for scaredy 
 cats and comes to you courtesy of our Whatsapp group chat!\n\nWe're headed
  to the 13th Hour Haunted House\, 105 West Dewey Ave\, Wharton\, at 6:45 p
 .m. on Sunday\, Nov. 1.\n\nLooks like it'll be $45! Tickets can be purchas
 ed online or at the door. Thursday nights tend to have the shortest lines.
  We may have to split into multiple groups depending on the number of atte
 ndees.\n\nHere's the website: https://13thhour.com/\n\nQuestions? Concerns
 ? Ideas? Comment below\, or you can reach Andy Milone at 201-234-9609 (cal
 l or text).\n\nHope you'll join us\, or consider attending one of our bowl
 ing\, volleyball\, tennis\, or other activities -> [www.meetup.com/north-j
 ersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball](https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowli
 ng-soccer-volleyball)
