SUMMARY:Board Game Night - Paris Baguette
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\n**Join us f
 or a board game event! Please bring your favorite board games to the event
 ! We can play games like chess\, parcheesi\, etc**\n\n**We will be meeting
  at Paris Baguette in Paramus\, NJ!**\n\n**Paris Baguette has pastries\, b
 akery items\, and coffee.**\n\n**If you are not feeling well\, please do n
 ot attend our event.Thank you!**\n\n**NOTE: If you are not attending the e
 vent\, please change your RSVP accordingly.**
